            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:q3UOOwkt5/ZXcQjL1Aq:0:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "The interior of the female figure cites an extract from Paul Géraldy's poem "
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:q3UOOwkt5/ZXcQjL1Aq:0:1",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "Mea Culpa",
                  "italic": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:q3UOOwkt5/ZXcQjL1Aq:0:2",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": ": “Au fond, vois-tu, mon erreur, ma grande folie, c'est d'avoir chargé ton cœur de tout le poids de ma vie” — taken from the book "
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:q3UOOwkt5/ZXcQjL1Aq:0:3",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "Moi et Toi",
                  "italic": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:q3UOOwkt5/ZXcQjL1Aq:0:4",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": ", a source of inspiration for the artist."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:q3UOOwkt5/ZXcQjL1Aq:1",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:q3UOOwkt5/ZXcQjL1Aq:1:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "In the metaphor of the unexpressed struggle for recognition of the Ego, the woman is hopelessly "
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:q3UOOwkt5/ZXcQjL1Aq:1:1",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "Damaged",
                  "italic": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:q3UOOwkt5/ZXcQjL1Aq:1:2",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "."
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
