                "id": "v:QKjJSV9dJ/ZXcQjL1Aq:0:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "Words welded together determine enigmatic identities. In the communicative energy of language and the universality of poetry, the artist yearns for rebirth — the materialisation and transfiguration of the "
